@startuml
title Arc transaction lifecycle today (arc-node)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF6F0
  ParticipantBorderColor #2E8B67
  LifeLineBorderColor #2E8B67
}
actor User
participant "RPC node\n(EL, Reth)" as RPC
participant "Txpool\n(tip-ordered + Denylist)" as POOL
participant "Proposer\n(round-robin)" as PROP
participant "Validators\n(Malachite BFT)" as VALS
participant "EVM handler" as EVM
User -> RPC : eth_sendRawTransaction (gas in USDC)
RPC -> POOL : validate, blocklist check
note right of POOL : pending-tx RPC hidden,\nbundles disabled,\nno encryption
PROP -> POOL : select txs by tip
PROP -> VALS : propose block ((h-1+r) mod n)
VALS -> VALS : prevote / precommit\n(2/3+ voting power)
VALS -> EVM : decided block executed
EVM -> PROP : base fee + tip credited\nto fee recipient (USDC)
EVM --> User : final in one block\n(~0.5 s target)
@enduml
